 <h3><u>Sughra acha hi kiya</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye sughra..(2)<br> Haaye<br> Jo chhut ke shaam ke zindaa se aayi binte ali<br> Nabi ke roze pe sughra se roke kehne lagi<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)<br> <br> Warna meri tarha chhin jaati tumhari bhi rida<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)<br> <br> 1. Tum charagho ko yaha takti rahi shamo sahar<br> khoo rulati thi tumhe roz yaha yaad e padar<br> tumne akbar ke kaleje me na dekha naiza<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)<br> <br> 2. Kya batau ke waha kaise masaeb toote<br> ek hi roz me sab god ke paale chhoote<br> ek ek laash pe khaimo me qayamat thi bapa<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)<br> <br> 3. Kis tarha aun o mohd ke janaze aaye<br> shaah maqtal se unhe kaise utha kar laye<br> sunke karti ho buka dekh ke aajati qaza<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)<br> <br> 4. Ghash pe ghash khaati thi saidaniya karti thi buka<br> ek ghatri me jo qasim ka sarapa aaya<br> us ghadi khaima e sadaat me mehshar tha bapa<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)<br> <br> 5. Meri in ankho ne dekha hai wo manzar dukhiya<br> baap ke kaanpte haatho pe pisar ka laasha<br> saath akbar ke tumhara bhi janaza uthta<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Haye paani lene ko tarai pe gaya tha saqqa<br> phir alamdaar nahi sirf alam aaya tha<br> haye maqtal se kamar thaame tumhare baba<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)<br> <br> 7. Maslehat kya thi tumhe le na gaye kyu sarwar<br> asr e aashoor khula raaz ye sughra mujhpar<br> pushte shabbir pe qatil tha sarhane zehra<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)<br> <br> 8. Haye kaise manzar wo kare mazharo irfan bayaa<br> thi ye sughra ke qareeb zainab e muztar ki fughaa<br> mere baalo ki safedi me hai ye raaz chhupa<br> sughra acha hi kiya tum na gayi karbobala..(2)<br> Haye sughra..</p> 
